{Mitarbeiter} has excellent technical knowledge and worked with great care and independence, even under heavy deadline pressure. The quality of work was outstanding throughout. Conduct towards managers, colleagues and clients was always exemplary.
{Mitarbeiter} is leaving at their own request. We are very sorry to lose them, thank them for excellent work and recommend them without reservation.' }
